;Description
:This template is used to link to a Bilibili Video.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Bb|<bilibilivideoid>|description}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <bilibilivideoid> with the latter part of the Bilibili Video link (e.g., if the link is https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Aw411Z7VS, the bilibilivideoid will be "BV1Aw411Z7VS"). If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{T|Bb|BV1Aw411Z7VS|Akie's original song: 将遗憾写成歌|_Y_=1}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

